<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Måtinden from Baugtua — Baugtua–Måtind summit plateau return</name><desc>Leave the Baugtua/Baugtuva parking in Stavadalen, cross the wet moor and climb the steep stony slope to the plateau. Follow the clear path across the upland to the established Måtind summit plateau, enjoy the views over Høyvika and Bleiksøya, then return by the same route.

